::: {#c31675b3 .cell execution_count=20}
``` {.python .cell-code}
def k_sum_pairs_brute(a, k):
    n = len(a)
    used = [False] * n
    pairs = 0
    for i in range(n):
        if used[i]:
            continue
        for j in range(i + 1, n):
            if not used[j] and a[i] + a[j] == k:
                used[i] = used[j] = True
                pairs += 1
                break
    return pairs
```
