``` {.python .cell-code}
def longest_sort(a):
    s = sorted(set(a))
    if not s:
        return 0
    best = run = 1
    for i in range(1, len(s)):
        run = run + 1 if s[i] == s[i - 1] + 1 else 1
        best = max(best, run)
    return best
```
